{"product_id":"drop-vuolle","title":"Drop Vuolle","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Ys6uT4QafBo?si=Hglpn6UuGnyBHNoH\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\" allowfullscreen=\"\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" frameborder=\"0\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop Vuolle is a modern outdoor spa pool which combines Drop pool’s unfailing design with massaging nozzles and state-of-the-art outdoor spa technology. Vuolle outdoor spa pool is designed and made in Finland and guarantees a first-class bathing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Finnish word Vuolle refers to a section of a river with a powerful stream, a steady flow, and whirlpools at the edges. In Drop Vuolle outdoor spa pool, you can sense the murmur of the river as the light plays on the water’s surface and enjoy the calming effect of the warm water. In addition to its low-key and stylish appearance, the massaging nozzles guarantee that Drop Vuolle is a holistic experience for all senses.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis pool package is true everyday luxury! The pool has massage seats for four and 32 massage nozzles. The pool fits up to eight bathers at the same time. The pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically-heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"accordion tablinks active\" hidden=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"teknisettiedot\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\" id=\"sisalto\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu126511\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e32 nozzles, massage seats for four\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 1.5 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702261060,"sku":"301120509","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007065412,"sku":"301120508","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702293828,"sku":"301120209","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007098180,"sku":"301120208","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":39913702326596,"sku":"301120409","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007130948,"sku":"301120408","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47717007163716,"sku":"301120559","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47717007196484,"sku":"301120558","price":18500.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/Drop-design-spa-vuolle-product-SamuelTaipale2-1-_158_332.jpg?v=1677588650","url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/en-at\/products\/drop-vuolle","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}